			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202" title="View the profile of xaanru">xaanru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 49<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m not a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1116.msg11263#msg11263"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1116.msg11263#msg11263">Re: What is your favorite perverted or funny surname you have seen on RN</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> September 17, 2004, 06:15:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							My monk alt grouped with a shaman a few times, who had an interesting name. His first name was Gaxje (which as far as I could tell is just made up), however, his surname was Stfuplz.<br /><br />There is a cleric in my guild named Norezz Imafk. Also a druid named Whyz Arse.<br /><br /><br />Just a few that come to mind.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Xaanru 66th lvl Archon of Marr <br />&lt;Sons of Kings&gt; Rodcet Nife <br />Grandmaster Smith(250)* GM Trophy<br />Grandmaster Jeweler (250)<br />Grandmaster Tailor (250)<br />Master Baker(200)<br />Master Fletcher (200)<br />Master Jeweler (200)<br />Master Brewer (200)<br />Master Potter (194)<br />Master Fisherman (186)<br />Master Drunk (189)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
